x11/jgmenu:  Add jgmenu version 4.7.0

Jgmenu is simple, independent and contemporary-looking X11 menu, designed
for scripting, modding and tweaking. It has UTF-8 search support.

It can display the following types of menu (or any combination of):

    bespoke menu using a jgmenu flavoured CSV format
    application menu (XDG compatible) with localisation support
    pipe menus
    openbox XML menu including openbox pipe-menus

It optionally can use appearance settings fro XSettings, tint2 and GTK.
